                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kuhnar",
            text: _("Here we are! The hills of the Shorbear clan!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("We’re here to bargain with the Shorbears for their tools, who should take lead?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("I could-"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("<i>I’ll</i> be doing the talking! I remember what happened last time you negotiated a deal, Rugnur! We lost five thousand pieces of silver!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("Och, it’s some o’ them cave-dwarves. What business do you have here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("I’m Lord Durstorn, ruler of the Chaincolt Range. I have been told you are great jewel-workers, and so we come to rent some of your tools for a short time, a few years at most."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("You’re a <i>lord</i>?! Must be a pretty small clan for you to come yourself to bargain with us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("You insult me! Do you want my business, or not?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("Well, fine, I’ll hear your offer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("We’d like to rent your best tools for a short period of time. We’ll only be cutting one jewel with it. My starting offer is two hundred silver."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("It must be worth a lot for you to come this way and offer that much! How much are you going to sell it for, eh?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("That’s none of your concern!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("I’ll take twenty-five hundred, minimum."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("<small>(_Durstorn, that would be a quarter of all our profits!)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("I know that. Uh, Glonoin, how about five hundred?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("Twenty-three hundred is my lowest offer. I can tell I don’t need the money as much as you need the jewel cut!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("You must be mad! I’ll offer one thousand, but no higher!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("Two thousand, and I’ll go no lower!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("<small>(_What are we going to do? We can’t go much higher!)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("<small>(_Offer him fifteen hundred, but don’t go up, even if he refuses.)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("<small>(_Bah! Getting this cut isn’t worth that much — what with Rugnur’s mistake earlier, and all the other expenses. If we pay more than a thousand, we’ll barely even make a profit!)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("<small>(_So what are you going to do?)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("<small>(_Fight him, and take the tools by force.)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("<small>(_Are you mad?!)</small>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Of course not!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            portrait: "portraits/durstorn-insane.webp",
            text: _("Glonoin, yah scoundrel! One thousand was my final offer, and if you won’t accept that, we will take the tools from you by force!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glonoin",
            text: _("Hah! I’d like to see you try!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("You’re making a mistake, Durstorn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_city_falls.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "battle.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            portrait: "portraits/durstorn-insane.webp",
            text: _("Shut up, all of you! Attack them!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            unit: "Krawg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Look at him fly... if only we could move that fast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Krah!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Suddenly, the air was filled with the cries of another gryphon responding to Krawg’s call. The dwarves heard the flaps of wings and looked up to the sky to see another gryphon arriving."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Gryphon Rider",
            side: 1,
            x: 0,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("A brave dwarf ran out, grabbed it by the sturdy neck-feathers, and hauled himself up over its back. The big animal was friendly, took it all in stride, and seemed to understand what the pats and strokes of the dwarf’s hands meant."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You may now recruit Gryphon Riders."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Gryphon Rider",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "glildur",
            x: 1,
            y: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
